<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .address-block {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 60px;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 50px;
    font-size: 0.8em;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .list-item {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="text-align: left;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="width: 100px; height: auto;">
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">ANNA UNIVERSITY</h1>
        <div class="address-block" style="font-size: 12pt;">
          <span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Office: <span data-field="office">{{ office }}</span></div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Fax: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span></div>
      <div>E-mail: <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <div>
        <span data-field="document_number">Lr. No. {{ document_number }} / AU / CAI / App_Affln / 2022-23</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        Dated: <span data-field="date_issued">{{ date_issued }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>To</p>
    <p>The Chairperson / Principals of Affiliated Colleges</p>
    <p>of <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>, Chennai.</p>
    <p>Sir / Madam,</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Sub: <span data-field="subject_description">{{ subject_description }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>I am to inform you that a web application "Affiliation Monitoring System" is available for online submission of Application for Affiliation towards continuation of provisional affiliation for the existing course(s), variation in intake in the existing course(s) and new/ additional course(s) of B.E./B.Tech./B.Arch./M.E./M.Tech./M.Arch./M.B.A./M.C.A. programme(s) for the academic year 2022-23.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
      <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">&#9658;</span> Submission of online application should be done through the Anna University website <a href="http://cai.annau.edu/cai">http://cai.annau.edu/cai</a> the website can also be reached through the option 'Web Portal' under affiliation in the official website of Anna University.
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">&#9658;</span> The details of all the permanently affiliated courses conducted in the College should also be submitted online in the same form to the University.
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">&#9658;</span> The details of laboratory requirements are available in the Anna University website <a href="http://www.annau.edu/cai/labrequirements.php">http://www.annau.edu/cai/labrequirements.php</a>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">&#9658;</span> Faculty Qualifications, Experience, Scale of pay and Cadre Ratio should be strictly followed as per AICTE/UGC 7th CPC / COA(2020) norms for grant of Affiliation.
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">&#9658;</span> All Certificates, AICTE Faculty ID, PAN and Aadhaar details should be verified with the originals of Faculty Members before uploading the details to the University.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">&#9658; THE LAST DATE FOR SUBMITTING THE APPLICATION FOR AFFILIATION IS <span data-field="last_submission_date">{{ last_submission_date }}</span> (Thursday), 05:00 P.M.</p>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="margin-top: 0;">
    <p>The webportal will be opened for uploading the details from <span data-field="portal_opening_date">{{ portal_opening_date }}</span> (Monday), 10:00 A.M. onwards. You are requested to upload the application for provisional affiliation for the academic year 2022-23 with all relevant details and documents using the same 'Username' and 'Password' which was used last year.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>The processing of application, conducting inspection and granting affiliation are subjected to the fulfillment of the norms of Anna University and the following conditions:</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <ol>
      <li class="list-item">
        Consolidated Report generated, after submitting all the details of the application, should be maintained by the respective Colleges in the form of both <span data-field="report_format_1">{{ report_format_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="report_format_2">{{ report_format_2 }}</span>. It should be made available whenever demanded by the University.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        Summary Sheet of Application for Affiliation generated, should be duly signed by the Principal and the Chairperson of the College.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        Inspection / Processing fee should be made through RTGS/NEFT.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        RTGS/NEFT transaction details should be submitted in the prescribed format which is available in CAI website <a href="http://www.annau.edu/cai/format.php">http://www.annau.edu/cai/format.php</a>
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        The hard copy of the Summary Sheet of Application for Affiliation generated from the webportal and Payment Receipt should be submitted at the Respective Regional Centre of Anna University by the Colleges coming under Regional Centres of Anna University. The Colleges coming under Chennai Region should submit the same to the Director, Centre for Affiliation of Institutions, Anna University, Chennai – <span data-field="regional_centre_pin">{{ regional_centre_pin }}</span>.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        Colleges can admit students in the academic year 2022-23 ONLY after getting the grant of affiliation for the academic year 2022-23.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        The existing institutions which do not submit the online application within the last date will not be considered for the grant of affiliation for the academic year 2022-23.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        The last date for grant of affiliation is <span data-field="affiliation_grant_deadline">{{ affiliation_grant_deadline }}</span> May of the relevant year. Under any circumstances, affiliation cannot be granted to any Course in a College beyond the closing date for grant of affiliation.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        Online Application should be submitted on or before <span data-field="final_submission_date">{{ final_submission_date }}</span>, 05:00 P.M.
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">
        The requirements mentioned in the application for affiliation are subject to changes, if required on release of AICTE approval process handbook for the academic year 2022-2023.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <p>Yours sincerely</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
      <img src="placeholder_signature.png" alt="Signature" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span data-field="designation">{{ designation }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="footer">
  Page 1 of 2
</div>

</body>
</html>